        {
            "id": "https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/36943",
            "content_html": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">MDN URL</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FormData/delete\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FormData/delete</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What specific section or headline is this issue about?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I discovered a strange compatibility issue between the forEach method and the delete method of the FormData interface</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What information was incorrect, unhelpful, or incomplete?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">No</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What did you expect to see?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I tried to delete an item in FormData if it was empty, but strangely, if I didn't use the delete method inside forEach, it could iterate through all the empty items. However, if I used the delete method within forEach, it failed to iterate through all the empty items.<br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/98216285/389256499-b5df3df5-e22f-4ebc-9089-5186eb7fcda0.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..l8cTUyANoq730-idNVEFkO9ijl0FcN09JUGX6EjbvMc\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/98216285/389256499-b5df3df5-e22f-4ebc-9089-5186eb7fcda0.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..l8cTUyANoq730-idNVEFkO9ijl0FcN09JUGX6EjbvMc\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-11-24 144124\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a><br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/98216285/389256504-6bcad68e-a0df-4d50-914f-a8d2ea13c50f.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..UBruMW4wdta4zrWDk6__FRiD5KFfMs2bTXKydjqyJE8\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/98216285/389256504-6bcad68e-a0df-4d50-914f-a8d2ea13c50f.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..UBruMW4wdta4zrWDk6__FRiD5KFfMs2bTXKydjqyJE8\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-11-24 144036\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Do you have any supporting links, references, or citations?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>No response</em></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Do you have anything more you want to share?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>No response</em></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">MDN metadata</h3>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Page report details</summary>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Folder: <code class=\"notranslate\">en-us/web/api/formdata/delete</code></li>\n<li>MDN URL: <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FormData/delete\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FormData/delete</a></li>\n<li>GitHub URL: <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/formdata/delete/index.md\">https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/formdata/delete/index.md</a></li>\n<li>Last commit: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/2c641e08878722bf29fb784d58c61873ce4a133a/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/2c641e08878722bf29fb784d58c61873ce4a133a\"><tt>2c641e0</tt></a></li>\n<li>Document last modified: 2024-03-06T05:58:29.000Z</li>\n</ul>\n</details>",
