        {
            "id": "https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/23961",
            "content_html": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">MDN URL</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/XMLHttpRequest/abort\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/XMLHttpRequest/abort</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What specific section or headline is this issue about?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>No response</em></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What information was incorrect, unhelpful, or incomplete?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\"The XMLHttpRequest.abort() method aborts the request if it has already been sent. When a request is aborted, its <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/XMLHttpRequest/readyState\" rel=\"nofollow\">readyState</a> is changed to XMLHttpRequest.UNSENT (0) and the request's <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/XMLHttpRequest/status\" rel=\"nofollow\">status</a> code is set to 0.\"</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What did you expect to see?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Compare to the spec, it's clear that this doesn't cover the second case:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If <a href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this\" rel=\"nofollow\">this</a>’s <a href=\"https://xhr.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-xmlhttprequest-state\" rel=\"nofollow\">state</a> is opened with <a href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this\" rel=\"nofollow\">this</a>’s <a href=\"https://xhr.spec.whatwg.org/#send-flag\" rel=\"nofollow\">send() flag</a> set, headers received, or loading, then run the <a href=\"https://xhr.spec.whatwg.org/#request-error-steps\" rel=\"nofollow\">request error steps</a> for <a href=\"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this\" rel=\"nofollow\">this</a> and <a href=\"https://xhr.spec.whatwg.org/#event-xhr-abort\" rel=\"nofollow\">abort</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Do you have any supporting links, references, or citations?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>No response</em></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Do you have anything more you want to share?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>No response</em></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/23961",
            "title": "[xhr] xhr.abort is inaccurate",
